# Watchdog — kiem chung logic bang tclsh (khong co Questa tren may nay)

proc run_and_exit trong sim/tcl_files/config/vsim.tcl duoc trich ra va chay voi
stub cho cac lenh cua vsim (run/examine/quit/echo). Kiem tra 5 duong.

--- treo: watchdog bat, exit_status con -1 ---
  WATCHDOG|bat, gioi han thoi gian mo phong = 30 ms
  run 30 ms
  WATCHDOG|TIMEOUT sau 30 ms - testbench chua ket thuc
  WATCHDOG|exit_status van la EXIT_ERROR(-1), khong phai PASS cung khong phai FAIL
  => QUIT code=124
  ket qua: exit code 124
--- PASS: watchdog bat, ket thuc som ---
  WATCHDOG|bat, gioi han thoi gian mo phong = 30 ms
  run 30 ms
  WATCHDOG|testbench ket thuc truoc han, exit_status = 0
  => QUIT code=0
  ket qua: exit code 0
--- FAIL du lieu: watchdog bat, exit_status = 1 ---
  WATCHDOG|bat, gioi han thoi gian mo phong = 30 ms
  run 30 ms
  WATCHDOG|testbench ket thuc truoc han, exit_status = 1
  => QUIT code=1
  ket qua: exit code 1
--- loi khi run ---
  WATCHDOG|bat, gioi han thoi gian mo phong = 30 ms
  run 30 ms
  WATCHDOG|loi khi chay: vsim loi gia lap
  => QUIT code=1
  ket qua: exit code 1
--- khong dat SIM_TIMEOUT: hanh vi cu ---
  run -all (khong gioi han)
  => QUIT code=0
  ket qua: exit code 0

Quy uoc ma thoat:  0 = PASS   1 = FAIL du lieu   124 = TIMEOUT (giong lenh timeout)
